Main.java<pre><code>import java.util.concurrent.atomic.AtomicInteger;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) throws InterruptedException {
        AtomicInteger count = new AtomicInteger();
        Runnable task = () -&gt; {
            for (int i = 0; i &lt; 1000; i++) {
                count.incrementAndGet();
            }
        };

        Thread first = new Thread(task);
        Thread second = new Thread(task);
        first.start();
        second.start();
        first.join();
        second.join();

        System.out.println("Count: " + count.get());
    }
}
</code></pre> <p>输出：</p> <pre><code>Count: 2000
</code></pre> <p>原子自增避免了更新丢失，两个 <code>join()</code> 确保主线程在所有累加完成后读取结果。线程内部的执行先后顺序不影响本例最终结果。</p>

Main.java<pre><code>import java.util.List;
import java.util.function.Predicate;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        List&lt;String&gt; topics = List.of(" Java ", "IO", "", "Collections");
        Predicate&lt;String&gt; longEnough = name -&gt; name.length() &gt;= 4;

        List&lt;String&gt; result = topics.stream()
                .map(String::strip)
                .filter(longEnough)
                .sorted()
                .toList();

        System.out.println(result);
        System.out.println("Count: " + result.size());
    }
}
</code></pre> <p>输出：</p> <pre><code>[Collections, Java]
Count: 2
</code></pre> <p><code>map</code> 清理名称，<code>filter</code> 筛选长度，<code>sorted</code> 排序，<code>toList</code> 收集结果。Java 21 中的 <code>Stream.toList()</code> 返回不可修改的列表。</p>

Main.java<pre><code>import java.util.List;
import java.util.Map;
import java.util.TreeMap;
import java.util.stream.Collectors;

public class Main {
    record Student(String name, int score) {}

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        List&lt;Student&gt; students = List.of(
                new Student("Alex", 95),
                new Student("Bo", 88),
                new Student("Cindy", 82),
                new Student("Dana", 91)
        );

        double average = students.stream()
                .mapToInt(Student::score)
                .average()
                .orElse(0);

        Map&lt;String, List&lt;Student&gt;&gt; byGrade = students.stream()
                .collect(Collectors.groupingBy(
                        student -&gt; student.score() &gt;= 90 ? "A" : "B",
                        TreeMap::new,
                        Collectors.toList()));

        System.out.println("Average: " + average);
        byGrade.forEach((grade, members) -&gt;
                System.out.println(grade + ": " + members.stream().map(Student::name).toList()));
    }
}
</code></pre> <p>输出：</p> <pre><code>Average: 89.0
A: [Alex, Dana]
B: [Bo, Cindy]
</code></pre> <p><code>mapToInt</code> 把对象流转换为 <code>IntStream</code>，<code>average</code> 返回 <code>OptionalDouble</code>，空流时 <code>orElse(0)</code> 提供默认值。<code>groupingBy</code> 按分数线分成两组，显式传入 <code>TreeMap::new</code> 让分组的输出顺序固定，而不是依赖 <code>HashMap</code> 的遍历顺序。<code>record</code> 的写法见面向对象。</p>

Main.java<pre><code>public class Main {
    static int add(int left, int right) {
        return left + right;
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) throws ClassNotFoundException {
        Class&lt;?&gt; loaded = Class.forName("Main");
        System.out.println("Class: " + loaded.getName());
        System.out.println("Same type: " + (loaded == Main.class));
        System.out.println("Result: " + add(18, 24));
    }
}
</code></pre> <p>输出：</p> <pre><code>Class: Main
Same type: true
Result: 42
</code></pre> <p>编译后可以查看 <code>Main.class</code> 的字节码：</p> <pre><code>javap -c Main
</code></pre> <p><code>add</code> 方法对应的指令如下：</p> <pre><code>static int add(int, int);
  Code:
     0: iload_0
     1: iload_1
     2: iadd
     3: ireturn
</code></pre> <p><code>iload_0</code> 和 <code>iload_1</code> 把两个整数参数压入操作数栈，<code>iadd</code> 弹出并相加后压回结果，<code>ireturn</code> 返回整数。<code>javap</code> 展示的是 class 文件中的指令，通常不是 JIT 最终生成的机器码。</p>

Main.java<pre><code>import java.lang.annotation.ElementType;
import java.lang.annotation.Retention;
import java.lang.annotation.RetentionPolicy;
import java.lang.annotation.Target;
import java.lang.reflect.Method;

public class Main {
    @Retention(RetentionPolicy.RUNTIME)
    @Target(ElementType.METHOD)
    public @interface Topic {
        String value();
    }

    public static class Lesson {
        @Topic("Reflection")
        public String describe() {
            return "Read metadata, then call the method.";
        }
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) throws ReflectiveOperationException {
        Lesson lesson = new Lesson();
        Method method = Lesson.class.getMethod("describe");
        Topic topic = method.getAnnotation(Topic.class);

        System.out.println("Topic: " + topic.value());
        System.out.println(method.invoke(lesson));
    }
}
</code></pre> <p>输出：</p> <pre><code>Topic: Reflection
Read metadata, then call the method.
</code></pre> <p>示例明确知道注解存在，所以直接读取 <code>value()</code>。处理任意类型时，应检查 <code>getAnnotation()</code> 是否返回 <code>null</code>。</p>

Main.java<pre><code>import java.lang.reflect.Field;
import java.util.Arrays;
import java.util.Comparator;

public class Main {
    public static class Lesson {
        private final String title;
        private final int pages;

        public Lesson(String title, int pages) {
            this.title = title;
            this.pages = pages;
        }
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) throws ReflectiveOperationException {
        Lesson lesson = new Lesson("Java IO", 12);
        Class&lt;?&gt; type = lesson.getClass();

        System.out.println("Class: " + type.getSimpleName());
        Field[] fields = type.getDeclaredFields();
        Arrays.sort(fields, Comparator.comparing(Field::getName));
        for (Field field : fields) {
            field.setAccessible(true);
            System.out.println(field.getName() + " = " + field.get(lesson));
        }
    }
}
</code></pre> <p>输出：</p> <pre><code>Class: Lesson
pages = 12
title = Java IO
</code></pre> <p><code>getDeclaredFields</code> 的返回顺序没有保证，按名称排序后输出才固定。私有字段默认不能访问，<code>setAccessible(true)</code> 请求绕过检查；现代 Java 的模块边界可能限制这种操作，业务代码应优先使用公开 API。</p>

Main.java<pre><code>import java.util.ArrayList;
import java.util.LinkedHashMap;
import java.util.LinkedHashSet;
import java.util.List;
import java.util.Map;
import java.util.Set;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        List&lt;String&gt; topics = new ArrayList&lt;&gt;(List.of("Java", "IO", "Java"));
        Set&lt;String&gt; unique = new LinkedHashSet&lt;&gt;(topics);
        Map&lt;String, Integer&gt; counts = new LinkedHashMap&lt;&gt;();

        for (String topic : topics) {
            counts.merge(topic, 1, Integer::sum);
        }

        System.out.println("List: " + topics);
        System.out.println("Set: " + unique);
        System.out.println("Counts: " + counts);
    }
}
</code></pre> <p>输出：</p> <pre><code>List: [Java, IO, Java]
Set: [Java, IO]
Counts: {Java=2, IO=1}
</code></pre> <p>列表保留重复元素，集合负责去重，映射记录每个主题出现的次数。这里使用 <code>LinkedHashSet</code> 和 <code>LinkedHashMap</code> 保留首次插入顺序，使输出便于观察。</p>

Main.java<pre><code>import java.util.ArrayList;
import java.util.Comparator;
import java.util.LinkedHashMap;
import java.util.List;
import java.util.Map;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Map&lt;String, Integer&gt; scores = new LinkedHashMap&lt;&gt;();
        scores.put("Cindy", 82);
        scores.put("Alex", 95);
        scores.put("Bo", 88);

        List&lt;Map.Entry&lt;String, Integer&gt;&gt; entries = new ArrayList&lt;&gt;(scores.entrySet());
        entries.sort(Map.Entry.comparingByValue(Comparator.reverseOrder()));

        for (Map.Entry&lt;String, Integer&gt; entry : entries) {
            System.out.println(entry.getKey() + ": " + entry.getValue());
        }
    }
}
</code></pre> <p>输出：</p> <pre><code>Alex: 95
Bo: 88
Cindy: 82
</code></pre> <p><code>Map</code> 本身没有排序接口，先把 <code>entrySet()</code> 复制成列表再排序。<code>Map.Entry.comparingByValue</code> 按值比较，<code>reverseOrder</code> 得到从高到低的顺序；要按姓名排序时，可以换成 <code>comparingByKey</code>。</p>

Main.java<pre><code>public class Main {
    static int parseMinutes(String text) {
        int value = Integer.parseInt(text);
        if (value &lt;= 0) {
            throw new IllegalArgumentException("minutes must be positive");
        }
        return value;
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        String[] inputs = {"30", "abc", "-5"};
        for (String input : inputs) {
            try {
                System.out.println("Accepted: " + parseMinutes(input));
            } catch (NumberFormatException e) {
                System.out.println("Not a number: " + input);
            } catch (IllegalArgumentException e) {
                System.out.println("Invalid value: " + e.getMessage());
            }
        }
    }
}
</code></pre> <p>输出：</p> <pre><code>Accepted: 30
Not a number: abc
Invalid value: minutes must be positive
</code></pre> <p><code>NumberFormatException</code> 是 <code>IllegalArgumentException</code> 的子类。先捕获前者，才能为格式错误提供单独的提示；如果顺序颠倒，格式错误会落入更一般的分支。</p>

Main.java<pre><code>class InvalidMinutesException extends IllegalArgumentException {
    InvalidMinutesException(int minutes) {
        super("minutes out of range: " + minutes);
    }
}

public class Main {
    static void record(int minutes) {
        if (minutes &lt; 1 || minutes &gt; 240) {
            throw new InvalidMinutesException(minutes);
        }
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int[] inputs = {30, 300, 45};
        int accepted = 0;
        for (int input : inputs) {
            try {
                record(input);
                accepted++;
            } catch (InvalidMinutesException e) {
                System.out.println("Rejected: " + e.getMessage());
            } finally {
                System.out.println("Checked " + input);
            }
        }
        System.out.println("Accepted: " + accepted);
    }
}
</code></pre> <p>输出：</p> <pre><code>Checked 30
Rejected: minutes out of range: 300
Checked 300
Checked 45
Accepted: 2
</code></pre> <p><code>record</code> 对超出 1—240 分钟的值抛出带有具体取值的自定义异常，调用方可以同时获得类型和上下文。无论 <code>try</code> 是否成功，<code>finally</code> 都会输出检查记录；<code>300</code> 被拒绝后 <code>accepted</code> 不增加，最终接受两条。</p>

Main.java<pre><code>class Box&lt;T&gt; {
    private final T value;

    Box(T value) {
        this.value = value;
    }

    T get() {
        return value;
    }
}

public class Main {
    static &lt;T&gt; T first(T[] values) {
        if (values.length == 0) {
            throw new IllegalArgumentException("values must not be empty");
        }
        return values[0];
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Box&lt;String&gt; topic = new Box&lt;&gt;("Generics");
        Box&lt;Integer&gt; minutes = new Box&lt;&gt;(35);
        System.out.println(topic.get());
        System.out.println(minutes.get());
        System.out.println(first(new String[]{"Java", "Python"}));
    }
}
</code></pre> <p>输出：</p> <pre><code>Generics
35
Java
</code></pre> <p><code>Box</code> 的类型参数属于类，<code>first</code> 的类型参数则声明在方法的返回类型之前。<code>new Box&lt;&gt;(35)</code> 中的空菱形让编译器推断类型实参，避免重复书写。</p>

写法 含义 <code>&lt;T extends Number&gt;</code> 类型参数必须是 <code>Number</code> 或其子类型 <code>List&lt;?&gt;</code> 元素类型未知的列表 <code>List&lt;? extends Number&gt;</code> 接收某一种 <code>Number</code> 子类型的列表，适合按 <code>Number</code> 读取 <code>List&lt;? super Integer&gt;</code> 接收 <code>Integer</code> 或其父类型的列表，可以添加 <code>Integer</code> <p><code>List&lt;Integer&gt;</code> 不能直接赋值给 <code>List&lt;Number&gt;</code>。如果允许这种赋值，调用方就可能向原本只接受整数的列表中放入其他数字类型。</p> <p>下面的方法接收整数或浮点数列表并计算总和：</p> <pre><code>static double sum(List&lt;? extends Number&gt; values) {
    double total = 0;
    for (Number value : values) {
        total += value.doubleValue();
    }
    return total;
}
</code></pre> <p>使用 <code>extends</code> 时，具体元素类型未知，通常不能向该列表添加非 <code>null</code> 值。使用 <code>super</code> 时可以写入相应类型，但取出的值只能安全地按 <code>Object</code> 处理。简记为 PECS：只读取用 <code>extends</code>，只写入用 <code>super</code>。</p>

Main.java<pre><code>import java.util.ArrayList;
import java.util.List;

public class Main {
    static void addScore(List&lt;? super Integer&gt; scores) {
        scores.add(88);
    }

    static double average(List&lt;? extends Number&gt; scores) {
        double total = 0;
        for (Number score : scores) {
            total += score.doubleValue();
        }
        return total / scores.size();
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        List&lt;Number&gt; records = new ArrayList&lt;&gt;();
        addScore(records);
        addScore(records);
        System.out.println("Average: " + average(records));
    }
}
</code></pre> <p>输出：</p> <pre><code>Average: 88.0
</code></pre> <p><code>records</code> 是 <code>List&lt;Number&gt;</code>，同时满足 <code>? super Integer</code> 和 <code>? extends Number</code>。<code>addScore</code> 只需要向列表写入 <code>Integer</code>，用下界通配符；<code>average</code> 只需要按 <code>Number</code> 读取元素，用上界通配符。方法各取所需，调用方不需要改变列表的类型声明。</p>

Main.java<pre><code>import java.io.IOException;
import java.io.RandomAccessFile;
import java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets;
import java.nio.file.Files;
import java.nio.file.Path;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {
        Path directory = Files.createTempDirectory("java-random-");
        Path file = directory.resolve("records.bin");
        try {
            try (RandomAccessFile raf = new RandomAccessFile(file.toFile(), "rw")) {
                raf.write("AAAA".getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8));
                raf.write("BBBB".getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8));

                raf.seek(0);
                raf.write("JAVA".getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8));

                raf.seek(4);
                byte[] data = new byte[4];
                raf.readFully(data);
                System.out.println("Second block: " + new String(data, StandardCharsets.UTF_8));
                System.out.println("Length: " + raf.length());
            }
            System.out.println("File content: " + Files.readString(file, StandardCharsets.UTF_8));
        } finally {
            Files.deleteIfExists(file);
            Files.deleteIfExists(directory);
        }
    }
}
</code></pre> <p>输出：</p> <pre><code>Second block: BBBB
Length: 8
File content: JAVABBBB
</code></pre> <p>先写入 8 个字节，<code>seek(0)</code> 把指针移回开头并覆盖前 4 个字节为 <code>JAVA</code>，因此文件内容变为 <code>JAVABBBB</code>。再次 <code>seek(4)</code> 后读取 4 个字节，得到第二块 <code>BBBB</code>。随机访问适合固定长度记录、索引文件等场景；文本替换时要注意新旧内容的长度关系，覆盖不足会留下残余字节，覆盖过长会改写后续内容。</p>

Main.java<pre><code>import java.io.ByteArrayInputStream;
import java.io.ByteArrayOutputStream;
import java.io.IOException;
import java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {
        ByteArrayOutputStream out = new ByteArrayOutputStream();
        out.write("Hello".getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8));
        out.write(',');
        out.write("Java".getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8));

        byte[] data = out.toByteArray();
        System.out.println("Size: " + data.length);

        ByteArrayInputStream in = new ByteArrayInputStream(data);
        byte[] buffer = new byte[5];
        int count;
        while ((count = in.read(buffer)) != -1) {
            System.out.print(new String(buffer, 0, count, StandardCharsets.UTF_8));
        }
        System.out.println();
    }
}
</code></pre> <p>输出：</p> <pre><code>Size: 10
Hello,Java
</code></pre> <p><code>ByteArrayOutputStream</code> 会随着写入自动扩展内部数组，<code>toByteArray()</code> 返回当前内容的副本。<code>ByteArrayInputStream</code> 从同一个数组读取，<code>read(buffer)</code> 返回实际读取的字节数；循环必须使用 <code>count</code> 构造字符串，不能假定每次都能填满数组。</p>

Main.java<pre><code>import java.io.BufferedReader;
import java.io.BufferedWriter;
import java.io.FileInputStream;
import java.io.FileOutputStream;
import java.io.IOException;
import java.io.InputStreamReader;
import java.io.OutputStreamWriter;
import java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets;
import java.nio.file.Files;
import java.nio.file.Path;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {
        Path directory = Files.createTempDirectory("java-char-io-");
        Path file = directory.resolve("courses.txt");
        try {
            try (BufferedWriter writer = new BufferedWriter(
                    new OutputStreamWriter(new FileOutputStream(file.toFile()), StandardCharsets.UTF_8))) {
                writer.write("Java");
                writer.newLine();
                writer.write("IO");
                writer.newLine();
            }

            try (BufferedReader reader = new BufferedReader(
                    new InputStreamReader(new FileInputStream(file.toFile()), StandardCharsets.UTF_8))) {
                String line;
                while ((line = reader.readLine()) != null) {
                    System.out.println("Line: " + line);
                }
            }
        } finally {
            Files.deleteIfExists(file);
            Files.deleteIfExists(directory);
        }
    }
}
</code></pre> <p>输出：</p> <pre><code>Line: Java
Line: IO
</code></pre> <p>写入端的包装顺序是文件字节流、编码转换流和缓冲字符流：<code>FileOutputStream</code> 负责写字节，<code>OutputStreamWriter</code> 负责按 UTF-8 编码字符，<code>BufferedWriter</code> 负责减少实际写出次数。读取端按相反顺序组合，<code>InputStreamReader</code> 把字节解码为字符。关闭最外层的 <code>BufferedWriter</code> 或 <code>BufferedReader</code> 时，内层流也会被关闭。</p>

Main.java<pre><code>import java.io.BufferedInputStream;
import java.io.BufferedOutputStream;
import java.io.DataInputStream;
import java.io.DataOutputStream;
import java.io.FileInputStream;
import java.io.FileOutputStream;
