            }
        } finally {
            Files.deleteIfExists(file);
            Files.deleteIfExists(directory);
        }
    }
}
</code></pre> <p>输出：</p> <pre><code>Year: 2026
Topic: Java IO
Score: 95.5
Passed: true
</code></pre> <p>写入和读取使用完全相同的类型顺序。<code>writeUTF</code> 会先写入字符串长度，再写入修改后的 UTF-8 字节，因此 <code>readUTF</code> 能准确还原字符串边界。这个文件是二进制格式，用文本编辑器打开通常无法直接阅读。</p>

Main.java<pre><code>import java.io.BufferedInputStream;
import java.io.BufferedOutputStream;
import java.io.FileInputStream;
import java.io.FileOutputStream;
import java.io.IOException;
import java.io.ObjectInputStream;
import java.io.ObjectOutputStream;
import java.io.Serializable;
import java.nio.file.Files;
import java.nio.file.Path;

public class Main {
    static class Course implements Serializable {
        private static final long serialVersionUID = 1L;

        private final String name;
        private final int minutes;
        private transient String note = "temporary";

        Course(String name, int minutes) {
            this.name = name;
            this.minutes = minutes;
        }

        @Override
        public String toString() {
            return name + " (" + minutes + " minutes, note=" + note + ")";
        }
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException, ClassNotFoundException {
        Path directory = Files.createTempDirectory("java-object-io-");
        Path file = directory.resolve("course.bin");
        try {
            Course saved = new Course("Java IO", 90);
            try (ObjectOutputStream out = new ObjectOutputStream(
                    new BufferedOutputStream(new FileOutputStream(file.toFile())))) {
                out.writeObject(saved);
            }

            Course loaded;
            try (ObjectInputStream in = new ObjectInputStream(
                    new BufferedInputStream(new FileInputStream(file.toFile())))) {
                loaded = (Course) in.readObject();
            }
            System.out.println(loaded);
        } finally {
            Files.deleteIfExists(file);
            Files.deleteIfExists(directory);
        }
    }
}
</code></pre> <p>输出：</p> <pre><code>Java IO (90 minutes, note=null)
