Main.java<pre><code>abstract class Task {
    private final String name;

    Task(String name) {
        this.name = name;
    }

    String name() {
        return name;
    }

    abstract int minutes();

    String report() {
        return name + " takes " + minutes() + " minutes";
    }
}

class ReadingTask extends Task {
    private final int pages;

    ReadingTask(String name, int pages) {
        super(name);
        this.pages = pages;
    }

    @Override
    int minutes() {
        return pages * 3;
    }
}

class CodingTask extends Task {
    private final int problems;

    CodingTask(String name, int problems) {
        super(name);
        this.problems = problems;
    }

    @Override
    int minutes() {
        return problems * 15;
    }
}

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Task[] tasks = {
            new ReadingTask("Java basics", 12),
            new CodingTask("Loop practice", 3)
        };
        for (Task task : tasks) {
            System.out.println(task.report());
        }
    }
}
</code></pre> <p>输出：</p> <pre><code>Java basics takes 36 minutes
Loop practice takes 45 minutes
</code></pre> <p><code>Task</code> 是抽象类，<code>minutes()</code> 没有实现，两个子类分别按页数和题目数计算时长。<code>report()</code> 定义在 <code>Task</code> 中，调用 <code>minutes()</code> 时按实际对象分派到子类实现。数组里的声明类型都是 <code>Task</code>，循环中的调用体现了多态。</p>

